{"id":"re_pe_tition","lemma":"répétition","pos":"noun","rank":2989,"glosses":["repetition","rehearsal"],"ipa":"/ʁe.pe.ti.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/55/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-r%C3%A9p%C3%A9tition.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-r%C3%A9p%C3%A9tition.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"répétitions"},"formAudio":{"répétitions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/07/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-r%C3%A9p%C3%A9titions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Répétition est mère d'apprentissage.","en":"Repetition is the mother of learning.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"mother"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"apprenticeship"}]},{"text":"Nous commencerons demain les répétitions.","en":"We'll begin rehearsals tomorrow.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to begin, commence","l":"commencer"},{"g":"tomorrow"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"La répétition ne transforme pas un mensonge en vérité.","en":"Repetition does not transform a lie into a truth.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to transform","l":"transformer"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"lie, falsehood"},null,null],"phrases":[[7,9,"in truth"]]},{"text":"Après une pause de dix minutes, nous avons repris notre répétition.","en":"After a ten-minute break, we resumed our rehearsal.","words":[{"g":"after"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"pause, break"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"ten"},{"g":"minute","l":"minute"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to take back","l":"reprendre"},{"g":"our"},null]},{"text":"C'est la répétition qui t'aide à te souvenir de quelque chose.","en":"Repetition helps you remember something.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"who"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"help, support"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"memory"},{"g":"of / from"},null,null],"phrases":[[11,13,"something"]]}]}